00:01:30.659 --> 00:01:33.328
- She's eating us out of house and home.
- It's just a bagel.

00:01:33.536 --> 00:01:35.246
No. No, no, it's never just a bagel.

00:01:35.455 --> 00:01:38.582
As someone who's basically been
a shut-in for the last 17 years...

00:01:38.791 --> 00:01:41.793
