00:03:03.194 --> 00:03:04.737
Okay, well, come on.

00:03:05.696 --> 00:03:08.866
Hey, later, can we finish this chat?
Put in a little Seth-Ryan time?

00:03:09.074 --> 00:03:13.119
Yes. Absolutely,
just gotta check with...

00:03:13.745 --> 00:03:15.121
Oh, you forgot your balls.

00:03:15.329 --> 00:03:18.874
- You and me. Tonight.
- Come on.

00:04:01.701 --> 00:04:04.370
- Are we one of those couples?
- Who lose all their friends?

