00:04:06.205 --> 00:04:08.249
I don't think so. You think so?

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:13.586
- That'd be good, a night apart.
- Yeah, plus, I'm kind of sick of you.

00:04:13.795 --> 00:04:15.963
I'm sick of me too.

00:04:16.881 --> 00:04:20.050
